## ----------------------------------------------------------------------
## .gitignore - Practical Test Xtramile (.NET 10 & Web Client)
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# Assessment & Problem Specification (Confidential / Do not track in Git)
[Dd]ocument.md
[Dd]ocument_*.md

# Build Results & Binaries
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
build/

# Visual Studio & IDE Caches
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.ide
*.sln.docstates

# Local Database Files (SQLite generated at runtime)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
App_Data/*.db
App_Data/*.db-shm
App_Data/*.db-wal
!App_Data/.gitkeep

# Logs & Diagnostics
*.log
*.DiagnosticStore*

# Test Results & Coverage
TestResults/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/

# OS Generated Files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Node / NPM (if used)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
